Short:        Full (assembler) source code for GhostRider
Author:       jskov@iesd.auc.dk
Uploader:     jskov iesd auc dk
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This archive contains the development directory for my hardware
monitor GhostRider. There is more than 500kB pure assembler source. I
hope this will be of some help to you if you are learning assembler,
or if you just want to have a look at the source of a "bigger"
project.

Please read the readme file in the archive. I ask you to send me
5-10$US depending on how you are using the source.

/Jesper
